{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hardest Game in Town is... Hard. But simple. But hard (grin).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it's a math game. But a nasty one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match the numbers in the matrix so that they form correct math operations and score points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The harder the operation and the longer the series the higher the score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in several different modes and rules for even more HARDNESS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THGiT, a game you will love to hate!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1834680?t=1757945478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1834680?t=1757945478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834680/7a163722ca59cd7d94c5ddb91fa17bb0b0d9c454/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757945478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834680/7a163722ca59cd7d94c5ddb91fa17bb0b0d9c454/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757945478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hardest Game in Town is... Hard. But simple. But hard (grin).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it's a math game. But a nasty one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match the numbers in the matrix so that they form correct math operations and score points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The harder the operation and the longer the series the higher the score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in several different modes and rules for even more HARDNESS. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THGiT, a game you will love to hate!</p>","developers":["Pierluigi Pesenti"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"descrip